
## GET ALL ROOMS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/room/get-all?pageSize=100
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Building-Id: {{buildingId}}

GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/room/get-all?roomNumber=10
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
X-Building-Id: {{buildingId}}